        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"c0f03952-e067-4f25-99fc-18a1a045ed9f\",\"review_text\":\"Just move it back to the way it was😒\"},{\"review_id\":\"50626053-301c-42fa-91aa-2f88aef82e64\",\"review_text\":\"I say it's great for music but the ads is unbearable not only it's unskippable it's all 25+ sec long and you get 2 ads and when you want to choose a song in your playlist your getting another ad so shuffle is the only option here and I don't understand why would you need to pay to play songs in order aren't you earning enough Spotify?\"},{\"review_id\":\"d96a2bff-54e8-427a-ad8d-01d5550a0875\",\"review_text\":\"The best app for music\"},{\"review_id\":\"3db7e65c-e5c0-431b-a107-28efeaae5acc\",\"review_text\":\"Love Rogan and you gotem\"},{\"review_id\":\"f87fb3d9-501a-4119-bc40-b0669270ae44\",\"review_text\":\"It doesn't work with mobile data on my phone!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"e393cec1-67e8-4f58-a484-8d9d76dc8fd6\",\"review_text\":\"I put my selection on shuffle plays same songs over and over\"},{\"review_id\":\"4519d4b9-f083-4035-b478-338b73322b47\",\"review_text\":\"Bring back lyrics feature 🐌\"},{\"review_id\":\"3b85826d-de5f-4cd0-b985-19697c467fd5\",\"review_text\":\"I love it\"},{\"review_id\":\"be84cf74-541f-49c8-8262-fe6e9faedfb8\",\"review_text\":\"Worst ever 100 tyms asked to join premium 😖\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc915d09-97ce-4d74-a04e-77d8f2d00e85\",\"review_text\":\"I love it lots of music that you want to hear. Saving your music is easy. It's been a blessing for me and family and friends. 💕🔥❤️\"}]}"
